Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.19,0:00:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.19,0:01:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of freak picks a giant\Nboat to be his deck master?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.93,0:01:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be really powerful, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.33,0:01:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's opening up, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.33,0:01:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's swallowing every monster\Nthat's been sent to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you wondering what\Nhappened to all your monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.65,0:01:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as that sphere holds my brain, my\Nship now holds a precious cargo of its own,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.93,0:01:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And from now on, every time a monster\Nis sent to the Card Graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,it will be rerouted directly\Ninto the belly of Shinato's Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.51,0:01:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And there it shall live\Nfor the rest of the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.23,0:01:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say I'm collecting\Npassengers, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.13,0:01:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happens to those\Nmonsters once they enter the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a feeling we'll find out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You find this funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.51,0:01:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I find you pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:02:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your giant flood card, you have\Nno monsters on the field or in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.67,0:02:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.01,0:02:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I draw a monster now, you have\Nnothing to protect you from its attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're mistaken, amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.51,0:02:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is draw a monster\Nand I can attack him directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to lose now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.67,0:02:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I call to the field,\Nthe mighty Spear Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.63,0:02:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.65,0:02:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,With Cyclone Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that thing supposed to scare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.21,0:02:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I can block its attack\Nwith ease, Seto. With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, a creature you might\Nrecognize that now lives within my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise, Vampire Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my monster, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:03:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a passenger of Shinato's Ark,\Nwhich means he belongs to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my\NDeckmaster's special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have access to every\Nmonster on board my ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.59,0:03:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so go ahead and try to attack me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My vampire will absorb the impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah has the power to use every\Nmonster on board his ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So any time that Kaiba attacks him,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah can just summon a\Nmonster to protect himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, whenever a monster gets sent to the\Ngraveyard, it goes right into that boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting one thing, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.35,0:03:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dueling in my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And I control everything around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the looks of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.23,0:03:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a small taste of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.69,0:03:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, look at the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's drying up or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.23,0:03:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.45,0:03:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole virtual world is changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I command every part of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the dinosaur age.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.97,0:04:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Giant Rex!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.93,0:04:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your spear dragon's\Nabout to become extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.79,0:04:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant Rex, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.63,0:04:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky for you, your pitiful\Ndragon was in defense mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.07,0:04:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,so your life points were spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But I assure you, you won't\Nbe so lucky next time, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What, are you feeling frustrated?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.95,0:04:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Because now you realize that I'm\Nmore intelligent than you. Look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My superhuman brain sees everything,\Nand with each passing second, it grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like Noah's brain's up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.09,0:04:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,When my mind was digitized into\Nthat computer, something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Something unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:04:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed my brainwaves were\Nbeginning to grow more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.89,0:05:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to access vast\Namounts of information
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.87,0:05:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,through the databanks of my\Nfather's computer network.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I was constantly absorbing\Nfacts and figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned the answers to\Nmankind's greatest secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, I became a superhuman,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,infused with knowledge beyond\Nthat of anyone on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.51,0:05:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But all of this wisdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,all of this understanding, all of\Nthis intelligence wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Something was still missing from my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing, a thing I was never able to\Nachieve as a human, my father's trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.35,0:05:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I destroy you, I'll finally prove\Nto him that Kaiba Corp should be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a lowly human, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss the joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind your so-called superhuman intellect\Nis nothing but a spoiled little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.97,0:05:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.53,0:06:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,For your entire life, people\Njust handed things to you, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But I had to work for what I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.23,0:06:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaibokorp is mine because I earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fact that you think you\Ncan take it away from me by winning
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,One duel proves what I thought\Nabout you from the start, and what's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,that you're nuts you must have\Nspent one too many years trapped in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,that bubble in the sky Noah so you\Nthink I'm insane for wanting to claim
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,what's rightfully mine no I think\Nyou're insane for trapping me in a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.61,0:06:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,virtual computer program and forcing\Nme to duel you just to prove to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.61,0:06:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,your daddy that you're not the\Nfailure he thinks you are well I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.61,0:06:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,here to prove that you are there's\Na reason why I'm in charge of Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Corp and you're not. Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm the best man for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more fit to run that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,company than you'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.25,0:06:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And deep down your\Nfather always knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.79,0:06:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have been sleeping
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:07:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I remember I was in\Nthe hospital. Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was all just a dream. Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm locked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, hello, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.43,0:07:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, I had the weirdest dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.61,0:07:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in the hospital and\Neveryone was really worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.23,0:07:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it wasn't a dream, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,there was an accident and you were in bad
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body's gone. My team of scientists
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and researchers tried\Nto save you but nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.45,0:07:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,they did would help so I turned to my tech
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,experts and computer engineers and they
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.03,0:07:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,found the solution what do you mean you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.65,0:07:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand in time. I\Ncreated this dog for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,son you and he exist in\Na different way than the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,rest of us i soon discovered the meaning\Nof my father's words he created a new world
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.11,0:08:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,for me to live in hello noah good morning
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,hello but this world was\Nfar from perfect mint
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,chocolate chip ice cream i know it's your
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,favorite no thanks not\Ntoday mint chocolate chip
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,ice cream i know it's your favorite mint
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.45,0:08:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,chocolate chip ice cream\NI know it's your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The virtual environment I\Nlived in was full of glitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew some improvements\Nneeded to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you enjoyed your trip to Mars?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.83,0:08:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was by far the greatest birthday\Npresent I've ever gotten, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How many kids can say\Nthey've been to Mars?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course, the whole thing was\Njust a virtual experience in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I soon noticed a change in my\Nfather's attitude towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.85,0:09:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't celebrate without Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.19,0:09:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.63,0:09:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I just altered his programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.41,0:09:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I got bored, so I decided to\Nre-engineer Sam into a robot dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.91,0:09:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been working on a few other\Nprojects that you might be interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.29,0:09:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured out how to\Nimprove the capabilities
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.97,0:09:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,of the virtual world you created for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.73,0:09:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is connect our computer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,network to other systems\Nall around the world. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And you thought up this\Nlittle plan all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.47,0:09:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say, for the first\Ntime, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be surprised how much I've learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can see you've come a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:10:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think I have what it\Ntakes to run Kaiba Corp someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.17,0:10:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you have to admit that this virtual
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,existence has done\Nwonders for my intellect,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.43,0:10:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.34,0:10:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the perfect candidate\Nto take over this company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.41,0:10:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's, uh, discuss this further.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometime in the near future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.35,0:10:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But that discussion never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and soon father began focusing all\Nhis attention on his new family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.01,0:10:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,As for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,my father began to visit\Nless and less until
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,finally he chose to ignore me completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.97,0:10:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't believe that Kaiba Corp could\Nbe run properly by a virtual president.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, Gozaburo didn't give up on\Nyou because of your virtual state.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he knew that no matter\Nhow much knowledge you gained,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd always be a spoiled brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecting to get ahead in the world\Nwithout making any effort at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As despicable as your father was,\Nhe knew the value of hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.79,0:11:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It was his own determination for power\Nthat got him where he was, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.63,0:11:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And as much as it pained him to admit it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Gozoburo knew that I was the best\Nman for the job of KaibaCorp president.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.31,0:11:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for you, Noah, his real son?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You were better off isolated in your\Ncomputer world, out of everyone's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.19,0:11:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that could quite possibly\Nbe the most ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.29,0:11:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,thing that I've ever\Nheard in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My father wanting you to be president?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.69,0:11:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think he created\Nthat digital dump for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You were in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually believe my father put me\Nhere to focus his attention on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, you always thought you were top dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but of the three Kaiba brothers,\Nyou're the low man on the totem pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're confused, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.71,0:11:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your slot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.53,0:11:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we ask Mokulo\Nwhat he thinks, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.65,0:12:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Help Noah, my one true brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I play this Pot of Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows me to draw two new\Ncards to refresh my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.49,0:12:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As if that'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's the time to activate my\NDeck Master's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.69,0:12:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiser Seahorse allows\Nme to summon a powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.23,0:12:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,monster without having to\Nsacrifice a weaker one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So now I call to the field my\Nunstoppable Different Dimension Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place these three cards\Nface down. And end my turn, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Kaiba thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah's dino is going to blast\Nhis dragon into the Stone Age
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like last time Noah could\Nwin this duel in his next turn
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not good. Kaiba's no\Nfool. I'm sure those face down
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Cards are part of his plan to win this.\NThat's all you've got? What a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:13:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this duel's\Nabout to end in my victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto! As I take the Kaiba\NCorporation by storm for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the magic card's deepest impact
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the skies and unleash your devastating\Npower I've got a bad feeling about this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me when it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.13,0:13:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,History teaches us that\Nthe age of the dinosaurs
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,abruptly ended thanks to a meteor shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the Earth cooled off\Nand the Ice Age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.91,0:13:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we all know, there were no dinosaurs\Non Earth during the Ice Age, so goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,my giant Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That Rex was his!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me crazy, but if you ask me,\Nthat boy's not right in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.49,0:13:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be wondering why I used my\NDeepest Impact Magic card to wipe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,out all monsters on the field and\Ncut both of our life points in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.89,0:14:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's all part of evolution, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It weeds out the weak and helpless\Nand allows only the strong to thrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm safe. Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My Magic card Ice Age Panic is\Nabout to lead to your extinction
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,by allowing me to summon the most\Npowerful beasts of the Ice Age, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet last Tusk Mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man. That's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.03,0:14:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, time to bring back this\Ndifferent dimension dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.09,0:14:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to me now in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My beast has the power to travel between\Ndimensions, and now he's back in hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And, unfortunately for you, my\Ndragon is stronger than your mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.27,0:14:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, brace yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.11,0:14:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm about to rewrite history\Nby cutting short the Ice Age.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So prepare to lose your mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.47,0:14:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,His time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know better than anyone\Nthat the past can't be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My tusk mammoth will destroy your dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.39,0:15:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it me, or is Noah going to attack\Na monster that's stronger than his?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in for quite a surprise now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.37,0:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in control here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba understands that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.19,0:15:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my world, and\Nyou're my prisoner. Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.01,0:15:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster's stronger. Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.77,0:15:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the special ability\Nof Noah's Tusk Mammoth,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,both players will lose life\Npoints when it's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So when Kaiba Klaib is that ding,\Nit's like he's attacking himself, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.55,0:15:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mammoth, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Trap Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring of Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This will stop your monster in its tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.17,0:15:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, I see that you're\Ngetting desperate, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.15,0:16:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true your Ring of Destruction\Nwill destroy my Tusk Mammoth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid you'll\Nlose life points, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when I activate my\Nmagic card, Ring of Defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It will shield my life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, nice move, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to put that little runt in his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.95,0:16:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your ice age is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you don't control everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.35,0:16:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, they're both down to\Ntheir last chunk of life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's just hope Kaiba\Ncan wipe out Noah's first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.91,0:16:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now it's\Ntime to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shaking in my boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll switch my dragon\Nfrom defense to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll send my Thunder\NDragon to the car graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,where he'll be absorbed by Shinato's arc.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But not before his special skill\Nkicks in, giving me two more dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.47,0:17:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll use Polymerization\Nto fuse them both together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,forming Twin-Headed Thunder Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to meet that\Nthing in a dark alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.87,0:17:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my Quick Attack\NMagic card, I can attack right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And with no monsters to protect you,\Nyour life points are as good as gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to have forgotten about\Nthe powers of my arc, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.23,0:17:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Every monster that has been sent\Nto the graveyard lives on board,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.15,0:17:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have access to all of them. Observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Kaiba had him\Nthat time. I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.81,0:17:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell right into my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.91,0:17:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I can wipe out what's left of your\Nlife points and end this family feud!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.75,0:17:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't forget your\NDeck Master's ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.89,0:17:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to summon those monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,For one reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So I could play this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Dragon's Rage,\Nand here's how it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If my monster's attack points are higher\Nthan your monster's defense points,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.59,0:18:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,the difference comes directly\Nout of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself as Different Dimension\NDragon attacks your giant Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,One monster down and one more to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.97,0:18:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now beat that last monster and it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.33,0:18:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where it all ends. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, twin-headed Thunder Dragon,\Nattack his giant soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to him, Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.29,0:18:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,if you want to attack my brother\NNoah, you'll have to go through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.17,0:18:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been brainwashed by Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.08,0:19:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Mokuba!\NProtect me! From him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the stranger that's trying\Nto break you and I apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stranger...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.95,0:19:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba has chosen sides based\Nupon his own free will, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.11,0:19:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking back, maybe you should\Nhave treated him with more respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I give him the support you never could.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.61,0:19:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't have to be this way, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But you left me with no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.99,0:19:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you have a decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.17,0:19:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Forfeit this duel and step down\Nas president of Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Or continue with your final attack\Nand risk losing Mokuba for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.81,0:19:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother's fate is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaiba attacks Noah now,\Nhe'll be attacking Mokuba also.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.19,0:19:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba or control of Kaiba Corp. Decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.19,0:19:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your choice will impact\Nthe rest of your life!
